{
  "id": "658",
  "title": "Have You Any Clue What Time It Is?",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-02-13",
  "synopsis": "Little He makes Lili worried by coming home late.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/967/f2d83378ba5617fe047e88965459ea6032863daa.mp3?1698350144",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "现在都几点了\n\n丽丽：那么晚了，你去哪儿了？\n小何：对不起。今天工作太多，我忘了时间。\n丽丽：你的手机呢？\n小何：手机没电了。\n丽丽：现在都几点了？你知道我有多担心你吗？你要是回来晚，应该给我打个电话。\n小何：我知道了，下次会注意的。",
    "traditional": "現在都幾點了\n\n麗麗：那麼晚了，你去哪兒了？\n小何：對不起。今天工作太多，我忘了時間。\n麗麗：你的手機呢？\n小何：手機沒電了。\n麗麗：現在都幾點了？你知道我有多擔心你嗎？你要是回來晚，應該給我打個電話。\n小何：我知道了，下次會注意的。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Have You Any Clue What Time It Is?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：那么晚了，你去哪儿了？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：那麼晚了，你去哪兒了？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nà me wǎn le nǐ qù nǎ'r le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: You’re so late. Where did you go?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小何：对不起。今天工作太多，我忘了时间。",
      "traditional": "小何：對不起。今天工作太多，我忘了時間。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé duì bu qǐ jīn tiān gōng zuò tài duō wǒ wàng le shí jiān",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: I’m sorry. I had a lot of work today and forgot the time."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：你的手机呢？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：你的手機呢？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nǐ de shǒu jī ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: What about your phone?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小何：手机没电了。",
      "traditional": "小何：手機沒電了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé shǒu jī méi diàn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: My phone is out of battery."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：现在都几点了？你知道我有多担心你吗？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：現在都幾點了？你知道我有多擔心你嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì xiàn zài dōu jǐ diǎn le nǐ zhī dào wǒ yǒu duō dān xīn nǐ ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "你要是回来晚，应该给我打个电话。",
      "traditional": "你要是回來晚，應該給我打個電話。",
      "pinyin": "nǐ yào shi huí lái wǎn yīng gāi gěi wǒ dǎ ge diàn huà",
      "english": "Lili: Do you have any clue what time it is? Do you know how worried I’ve been for you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "If you’re coming home late, you have to call me."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "小何：我知道了，下次会注意的。",
      "traditional": "小何：我知道了，下次會注意的。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé wǒ zhī dào le xià cì huì zhù yì de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Ok, I’ll be careful next time."
    }
  ],
